# The build context is an ALLOWLIST (docs/DEPLOY.md): only what the runtime image needs is
# sent to the builder. Everything else -- secrets (.env, key files), personal data
# (data/processed: citizen reports, audit log, Level-2 seeds), the unpublishable raw corpus
# (data/synthetic), local model bundles (models/), node_modules, tests and the Streamlit dev
# harness (app/, ADR D4) -- never reaches an image layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src
!site
!configs
!data
!scripts

# Re-excluded inside the allowed directories.
data/processed
data/synthetic
data/raw
data/real
data/cache
data/asr_capture/_wav
scripts/spikes
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db
**/*.pem
**/*.key
